{"id":"n88506-2-10","stage":4,"title":"품종 · 品种","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n88506-2-10-1","ko":"너희 강아지 참 귀엽다. 품종이 뭐니?","zh":"你们的狗狗真可爱。是什么品种啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너희","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"1","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"강아지","meaning":"小狗，狗崽","explanation":"강아지：小狗，狗崽","readings":[{"term":"강아지","audio":"/audio/94e82412553f09dd4eb4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15689","senseId":"1","lemma":"강아지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"귀엽다.","meaning":"可爱","explanation":"귀엽다：可爱；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"귀엽다","audio":"/audio/f6866c147cb407d922da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38323","senseId":"1","lemma":"귀엽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"품종이","meaning":"品种，种","explanation":"품종：品种，种；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"품종","audio":"/audio/df78224f9b55b5fa72c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88506","senseId":"2","lemma":"품종","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐니?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指代多个听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너히"]},{"id":"94e82412553f09dd","term":"강아지","zh":"小狗，狗崽","audio":"/audio/94e82412553f09dd4eb4.mp3","entryId":"15689","definition":"狗的崽子。","pronunciation":["강아지"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"f6866c147cb407d9","term":"귀엽다","zh":"可爱","audio":"/audio/f6866c147cb407d922da.mp3","entryId":"38323","definition":"看起来漂亮，或令人喜爱。","pronunciation":["귀ː엽따"]},{"id":"df78224f9b55b5fa","term":"품종","zh":"品种，种","audio":"/audio/df78224f9b55b5fa72c5.mp3","entryId":"88506","definition":"根据特征划分同一种类生物的单位。","pronunciation":["품ː종"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/9e8806cf5426c81c9e7b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n88506-2-10-2","ko":"귀엽지? 잡종이야.","zh":"可爱吧？是杂种狗哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"귀엽지?","meaning":"可爱","explanation":"귀엽다：可爱；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"귀엽다","audio":"/audio/f6866c147cb407d922da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38323","senseId":"1","lemma":"귀엽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잡종이야.","meaning":"杂交种","explanation":"잡종：杂交种；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"잡종","audio":"/audio/6c1ed366691df4bbea6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73325","senseId":"3","lemma":"잡종","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f6866c147cb407d9","term":"귀엽다","zh":"可爱","audio":"/audio/f6866c147cb407d922da.mp3","entryId":"38323","definition":"看起来漂亮，或令人喜爱。","pronunciation":["귀ː엽따"]},{"id":"6c1ed366691df4bb","term":"잡종","zh":"杂交种","audio":"/audio/6c1ed366691df4bbea6d.mp3","entryId":"73325","definition":"许多种遗传基因混合的生物。","pronunciation":["잡쫑"]}],"audio":"/audio/ce43d6c98ed21d8d8ec0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.906,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=88506","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":134,"sequenceScore":2.6313,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,